{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01YDdR42hpztas2Ukx6BZBMj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Implementation complete. `cmd/cat/main.go` implements all prd006-cat requirements (R1-R5):\n\n- **R1 (Default passthrough)**: Reads files in order or stdin, `io.Copy` fast path for binary passthrough, `-` as stdin, concatenation with no separator\n- **R2 (Line numbering)**: `-n` numbers all lines (width-6, tab separator), `-b` numbers non-blank only, `-b` overrides `-n`\n- **R3 (Blank squeezing)**: `-s` collapses consecutive blanks, works across file boundaries, compatible with numbering\n- **R4 (Non-printing display)**: `-v` caret/M- notation, `-E` dollar at line end, `-T` tab as `^I`, `-A`/`-e`/`-t` combinations, `-u` accepted silently\n- **R5 (Error handling)**: Exit 0 on success, exit 1 on file errors (continues processing), SIGPIPE handler exits 0 silently\n\nDesign decisions followed: D1 (transformation order), D2 (SIGPIPE pattern from cmd/ts), D3 (`io.Copy` fast path), D4 (manual flag parsing for combined flags)."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":398,"cache_read_input_tokens":129217,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":398},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"db497b30-e06d-4899-bad8-0347d99e464d","uuid":"974ea55a-7dc5-4afb-8900-90c42e8b1855"}
